[enu default]
M01_DREAM_01 =
"\cDAs you move closer, you feel your consciousness swaying with the motion of every flickering frame. Each moment you spend near this thing claims a "
"tiny fragment of your mind, seemingly absorbing it into the ominous darkness.";
M01_DREAM_01a = "\cD[Reach out to the entity]";
M01_DREAM_02 =
"\cDYour mind dissolves into the gargantuan presence before you. Moments later, it goes completely dark.\n\n"
"\cFYou sensed dogs searching for you, they follow your trail. You are dead, but only in the material sense. The world around you comes to life.";
M01_DREAM_03 =
"\cFYou are nothing. A mere drop of rain within a storm. Let go of reason and awareness. Exist in the complete emptiness and awaken to your new state.\n\n"
"Inhale. Then exhale the rich air. Inhale. Then exhale. Inhale... Exhale...\n\n"
"\cDAfter a brief moment, the trance ends.";

STUDENT_00 = "Egnimatic Figure";
STUDENT = "Disciple of Sarmipadhva";
STUDENT_01 =
"\cDThe large figure before you appears to be in a trance-like state. It does not acknowledge your presence. There is a possibility it doesn't even know you're here.";
STUDENT_01a = "\cD[Reach out to the entity]";
STUDENT_01a_1 =
"\cDYour mind dissolves into the gargantuan presence before you. Moments later, it goes completely dark.\n\n"
"\cFThe eye that sees the truth now closes. The anchor is lost to time, you will drown in the turbulent black water. But somewhere within the depths, you and forty-nine "
"other souls upheaved in desperate anger.";
STUDENT_01a_2 =
"\cFAn entire sector devastated. Minds wandered adrift this plane and the ones far away. Today marked the moment where man becomes dog. "
"They search for your dead body, and returned it here.\n\n"
"Now you see yourself through another's eyes, a light show of infinite fractals and energy expressed by the constants of the universe. "
"But this is merely premonition, it must be experienced to be true.\n\n"
"\cDAfter a brief moment, the trance ends.";
STUDENT_02 =
"\cDA slow, deafening voice reverberates in your mind, as if a thousand thunderbolts ignited simultaneously -- and sounds even louder still.\n\n"
"\cFO, HONORED - CHILD - OF - HARMONY.  WHAT - YOU - SEEK - LIES - IN - THE - WIND - AND - STORM.\n\n"
"\RETURN - FROM - THE - PATH - YOU'VE - WALKED.";
STUDENT_02a = "\cQ[Instinct] \cDBegin the ceremony.";

/*
M01_DREAM_01a = "\cQ[Strength] \cDExamine the Honored One.";
M01_DREAM_01b = "\cQ[Wits] \cDExamine the entity.";
M01_DREAM_01c = "\cQ[Physique] \cDExamine its flesh.";

M01_DREAM_02a =
"\cDThe Regal Explorers of the Stars... They haven't changed at all since you first encountered them.\n\n"

"Brimming with an unshakable resolve, these brave explorers were the first to bid farewell to their tribe and seek a new home. "
"This led them across all corners of the world, and when they eventually failed, they sought guidance from the universe.\n\n"

"Dying was not a concern, for some of them actively seek death in a meditative state. As a result, The Song bestowed God's mind upon them, "
"allowing them to roam the planes beyond as hunters.";

M01_DREAM_02b =
"\cDYour memory recalls that of the Exalted Dreamers, an urban legend about people who have achieved transcendence through extreme and lateral means. "
"A conviction based on the belief that the heights to which they may soar will only be equal to the depths to which they descend. "
"Meditating in such hazardous circumstances has granted them an edge to expand their horizons; it has unshackled their bodies from the burden of life.\n\n"

"Their physical body is said to be indestructible, and their mind roams the universe and its many dimensions as a Class 9 meta-lifeform. "
"You also recall that such an entity is described as having a cold and relentless existence, traversing the starless cosmic web and "
"preying on others during their psychic astral projection.";

M01_DREAM_02c =
"\cDOn closer inspection, it appears that you have some of this thing in you, or that this thing has some of you in it. "
"The line gets blurry more often than not. But still, you can see similar yet-not-quite the same mutations in the body in front of you. "
"Its flesh crawls and slithers, hastily filling the holes and structural decay within its tissue's rapid decomposition.\n\n"

"But beneath the ever-shifting flesh, there is a wealth of life. A strange, yet familiar alien life.\n\n"

"There's no place in the universe more dangerous than the Perimeter. This thing seems to have been the only one to succeed at transcending under "
"such duress. Its physicality inherits some of the transcendent traits, ever-renovating to withstand the conditions harboring their expanded minds.";

M01_DREAM_021 = "\cQ[Memory Reflex] \cDPerform the ceremonial hail. Pay your respects.";
M01_DREAM_022 = "\cDFollow the trail of psychic emanation left behind by this entity.";

M01_DREAM_03a =
"\cDYou have the impression that your actions are being noticed. There is an undeniable feeling that you have been understood and your intentions acknowledged. You are granted an audience.\n\n"
"Slowly, visions and ghostly abstractions begin to gently pass through your psyche. Most of it is incomprehensible, although there is an unmistakable "
"familiarity to it that you've long forgotten.";

M01_DREAM_031 = "\cDManifest your gratitude and ask for safe passage.";

M01_DREAM_03b =
"\cDYou are immediately plunged into a world that you don't see, but can only witness in your memory. Your senses are useless here, since you are no "
"longer in a world of things, but in a world of dreams. Foreign emotions and sensations wash over you, pulling your psyche in a million different ways. "
"None of them ring true; however, they could never be your emotions or sensations, since these are not your dreams.\n\n"

"But there, on the edge of your oneiric eye, you see a pair of searing dots locked onto you. Everything grinds to a halt, allowing you to "
"somewhat retain your bearings. You realize you're now moving through this entity's memories; much of it is unfathomable, as they fold inward and "
"blossom through in such a natural yet perplexing motion.\n\n"

"Sensing your intrusion, the psychic link is immediately cut off and you are banished from this domain. But one thing remains clear, the device you're "
"searching for is not here at this coordinate. There is only one location left to check.";

M01_DREAM_04 =
"\cDYour request for safe passage is granted. There will be no aggression primed to hinder your journey.\n\n"
"As your meeting comes to an end. You are also blessed with a parting gift from the ones beyond.";

STUDENT_00 = "Egnimatic Figure";
STUDENT = "Disciple of Sarmipadhva";
STUDENT_01 = "\cDSimilar to the being you've encountered a while ago. This formidable individual also remains unmoved in his meditative state.";
STUDENT_01a = "\cQ[Memory Reflex] \cDRecollect your memory of who this is.";
STUDENT_01b = "\cD[Request a way forward]";
STUDENT_01a_1 =
"\cDThis is a disciple of The Great Sage.\n\n"
"His body, though frail and desiccated, appears strong and defies even death. Each of his many arms reflects "
"the progress of his cultivation of mind. His eyes are blessed with a luminous orange glow, representing the enlightened "
"clarity to the cosmic truth. He exists in a state of complete stillness, unmoving and as solid as the earth."; 
STUDENT_01a_1a = "\cQ[Memory Reflex] \cDReflect further on the history of the disciples.";
STUDENT_01a_2 =
"\cDThey are the ones closest to understanding the clear light of reality. Only Sarmipadhva himself possesses this knowledge. A knowledge that "
"he gave to the Enlightened in the forms of sacred texts.\n\n"
"The texts explain the circumstances one must undergo in order to truly experience the inner richness of "
"one's own mind. Should one's own mind exist in a state of impurity, the teachings offers the mean on how one may "
"reconcile this instinctual disagreement.";
STUDENT_01b_1 =
"\cDThe disciple already knows why you are here, and where you must go. But first, customs are in order. A mental image starts to form in your head. "
"It is rather vast and difficult to grasp, like a crude shape struggling to form in a sea of static white noise. Yet one thing managed to stand out "
"perfectly clear: \cRyou must survive the next minutes.";
STUDENT_01b_2 =
"\cDThe disciple do not see this as a grueling struggle to the death. Rather, from his perspective, it is a light show of infinite fractals "
"and energy expressed by the constants of the universe.\n\n"
"The one that seeks the path forward must demonstrate not to the disciple, but rather to themselves that they are worthy of crossing beyond.";
STUDENT_01b_1a = "\cD[Fight]";
STUDENT_02 =
"\cDA slow, deafening voice reverberates in your mind, as if a thousand thunderbolts ignited simultaneously, and sounds even louder still.\n\n"
"\cFO, CHILD-OF-NOBLE-FAMILY. THE-ENERGY-DISPLAYED-HERE-IS-TRULY-INSPIRATIONAL. IT-IS-ENOUGH-TO-AWAKEN-EVEN-THE-GIANTS-BENEATH.\n\n"
"TO-GO-FORWARD. RETURN-THE-WAY-YOU'VE-ARRIVED.\n\n"
"WALK-NOW-IN-THE-PATH-OF-THE-ENLIGHTENED-TRADITION.";
STUDENT_02a = "\cD[Begin the ceremony]";
*/